{"annotations":{"destructiveHint":false,"openWorldHint":false,"readOnlyHint":true,"title":"Search verified local businesses"},"description":"Honeyguide is a registry of local businesses verified with the owner by Honeyguide in London (beauty, aesthetics, spa, wellness and other services); it is not a travel or safari company. Find by area, category, attributes or name. Category accepts a Google Business Profile category ID (gcid), its English label or a legacy service alias such as lashes or massage. Every name-query word must match the business name, a practitioner's name, handle or category label; words can match different fields in any order. Exact full names and handles rank first. Filter by exact supported attributes; languages use ISO 639-1 codes such as ru. Techniques, training details, hours, practitioners and action links are in the full record returned by get_business.","inputSchema":{"$schema":"https://json-schema.org/draft/2020-12/schema","additionalProperties":false,"properties":{"area":{"description":"Locality, neighbourhood, postcode district, postal code, region or city to search.","maxLength":60,"minLength":1,"type":"string"},"attributes":{"additionalProperties":{"anyOf":[{"maxLength":120,"type":"string"},{"type":"boolean"}]},"description":"Exact supported attribute filters; use ISO 639-1 codes for languages, such as ru.","propertyNames":{"maxLength":80,"type":"string"},"type":"object"},"category":{"description":"Google category ID (gcid), English label, or a legacy service specialism.","maxLength":80,"minLength":1,"type":"string"},"country":{"description":"ISO country code; omitted searches all supported countries.","enum":["GB","ES","PT","IT","GR","TR"],"type":"string"},"limit":{"default":10,"description":"Maximum number of results, from 1 to 20; defaults to 10.","maximum":20,"minimum":1,"type":"integer"},"name":{"description":"Business or practitioner name, handle or category words to match.","maxLength":80,"minLength":2,"type":"string"}},"requir